# ZoikoTax content — telecom training pack
#
# TRAINING FIXTURE ONLY (ZTAX-ENG-RESET-001 §2, §7). The territories XT, XQ,
# XV and XW are drawn from ISO 3166's user-assigned range so they can never
# collide with a real country, and every rate here is invented to exercise the
# machinery: a mixed bundle, a zero-rated component, a per-line charge, a
# provider-borne contribution, tax on tax, inclusive extraction, place of
# supply and a rate change at local midnight. Such fixtures are prohibited
# from customer production packs.
